      <pdf:Keywords>Machine Learning Platforms, Coding Agents, Large Language Models, Benchmark, Command Line Interface, Software Development Kit, Agent Skills, Sovereign Artificial Intelligence, MaskininlÃ¤rningsplattformar, Kodagenter, Stora sprÃ¥kmodeller, RiktmÃ¤rke, KommandoradsgrÃ¤nssnitt, ProgrammeringsgrÃ¤nssnitt, AgentfÃ¤rdigheter, SuverÃ¤n artificiell intelligens</pdf:Keywords>
